      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLOAT MY BOAT (1) drew wide last start and was safely held into 11th at this track over 2130m. Tackles a similar assignment and from this more favourable draw he can feature in the finish this time. BROUGHT TO LIGHT (8) has been competitive of late and kept the ball rolling last time when 9 metres from the winner in fourth over 2130m at this track. Has to contend with a very wide draw. Meets a similar line up and he is a strong winning hope. WALL STREET GIRL (6) is in the mix following a fourth at her most recent appearance over 2130m at this track. CURADH (7) was out of the money two runs ago then broke and finished fifth last start over 2130m at this track, coming home 9 metres from the winner. Must overcome a wide draw. Finds a nice race and can make up for that last start mishap.",
